 "notes": "Governor Fábio Mitidieri (PSD, ballot name 'Fábio') seeks re-election vs Valmir de Francisquinho (Republicanos). AtlasIntel also ran a scenario WITHOUT Valmir (Fábio 44.6, Ricardo Marques 25.1), suggesting a legal question over Valmir's candidacy; the with-Valmir scenario is used, as Quaest and RTBD late-September polls still list him. INOR (local institute, 27-29 Jul) is the only poll with Valmir ahead. Senate: Edvaldo Nogueira (PDT, 5-11%) and Coronel Rocha (PL, 2-8%) are counted in 'Outros' because of the 6-name cap; Edvaldo is roughly tied with Rodrigo Valadares, so the maintainer may swap them. No Jan-Apr 2026 polls found (RTBD's previous poll was Nov 2025). Poder360's write-up of RTBD 17-21 Sep shows a garbled 2nd round (66x35); Gazeta/Hora News figures (46x43) used.",
